tde-flatpak-trinity (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the source and binary package from "tdeflatpak" to "tde-flatpak-trinity",
    so that all Trinity add-on packages follow the
    tde-<name>-trinity scheme. The new package replaces and breaks
    the old one, so installing it removes the old package.
    No functional changes.

 -- Yjlion <32956705+Yjlion@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 21:15:20 -0500

tdeflatpak (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New "Browse" page: an app store view with categories and, for Flathub,
    the Popular, Trending, New and Recently Updated lists.
  * New application details dialog with description, screenshots, releases,
    sizes, download counts and requested permissions (local AppStream data
    and the Flathub web API).
  * New permission editor (per-user overrides, portal permissions, app data,
    blocking updates) and a "Flatpak Applications" Control Center module.
  * New preferences: default installation, periodic update checks, catalog
    age, Flathub web service, deleting app data on uninstall.

 -- Yjlion <32956705+Yjlion@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:00:00 -0600

